From 53191dcfb87a5957b5caea36af3c5a565e4bc9aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zhuqingping <zhuqingping1@contributor>

Date: Fri, 4 Jul 2025 11:58:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Count not null column optimization [post-fix]
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Since count(not_null_null) to count(0) optimization which would
remove the dependency on 'column' and thus allow for more covering
indexes. This feature belongs to one specific optimization strategies,
so we remove independent parameters 'rds_simplify_count_not_null' and
add it into 'optimizer_switch'.

Add more test cases(include prepared statement, stored procedure) for
count not null column optimization feature.

Fix compile error for gcc 11 environment, error message as follows:
```
devtoolset-11/root/usr/include/c++/11/bits/stl_map.h: In instantiation of ‘class std::map<Item*, Item*, std::less<Item*>, Mem_root_allocator<std::pair<const Item*, Item*> > >’:
mysql/sql/sql_plan_cache.h:84:7:   required from here
devtoolset-11/root/usr/include/c++/11/bits/stl_map.h:123:71: error: static assertion failed: std::map must have the same value_type as its allocator
  123 |       static_assert(is_same<typename _Alloc::value_type, value_type>::value,
      |                                                                       ^~~~~
devtoolset-11/root/usr/include/c++/11/bits/stl_map.h:123:71: note: ‘std::integral_constant<bool, false>::value’ evaluates to false
make[2]: *** [sql/CMakeFiles/sql_main.dir/mysqld.cc.o] Error 1
```
